!Proposed Definitions (not finished yet)

;__xo__: question word to which the answer is a number
;__ci'i__: infinity; when followed by a number, denotes a transfinite cardinal, such as ℵ{SUB(0)/}, or a transfinite ordinal, such as ω{SUB(0)/}.
;__no'o__: typical number
;__ka'o__: imaginary unit
;__pai__: pi
;__te'o__: e
''li te'o te'a ka'o bi'e pi'i pai su'i pa du li no''
;__tu'o__: null operand; inspecific number or placeholder digit